  "description": "<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Eulique is a cutting-edge brand specializing in anime-themed home decor, lifestyle products, and unique art pieces. We are committed to delivering high-quality, innovative, and artistic items that resonate with anime lovers and art enthusiasts alike. Our product range includes GlowFrames, GlowLamps, 3D Paper Art, and anime-inspired tees&mdash;each designed to bring a touch of magic and fandom into your everyday life.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Product Description:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Introducing our best-selling&nbsp;<strong>GlowFrame</strong>, a radiant piece of wall art that brings your favorite anime scenes to life. Made with premium materials and featuring customizable designs, our GlowFrames offer a mesmerizing visual experience. The LED backlighting adds a captivating glow, making it a perfect addition to any space. In addition, we offer a stunning range of <strong>3D Paper Art frames</strong> and high-quality <strong>anime tees</strong>, perfect for both collectors and fans who love to wear their passion.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">What sets our <strong>GlowFrame</strong> apart is its seamless blend of artistry and technology. Not only do we offer a variety of pre-designed themes from beloved anime series, but we also provide custom design options. The LED backlighting is energy-efficient, and the frames are built from durable, high-quality materials. Beyond our GlowFrames, our <strong>3D Paper Art</strong> captures intricate details with a stunning layered effect, and our <strong>anime tees</strong> feature vibrant designs that showcase your fandom in style.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">We offer flexible payment options, including credit/debit cards and PayPal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><strong>Shipping</strong>: Free shipping on orders over $89.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><strong>Returns</strong>: 30-day hassle-free returns.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><strong>Warranty</strong>: One-year limited warranty on all products.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\"><span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span>&bull;<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\"> </span><strong>Customer Support</strong>: 24/7 customer service via shop@eulique.com</p>",
